    <briefdescription>
<para>Controls a 2D camera with follow and zoom capabilities. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The <ref refid="classCameraController" kindref="compound">CameraController</ref> manages camera movement in two modes:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Follow mode: smoothly tracks a target entity (player)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Manual mode: controlled by WASD keys It also handles zoom via mouse scroll and clamps the camera to world boundaries.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>The camera position is smoothly interpolated (lerp) when in follow mode. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classCamera2D" kindref="compound">Camera2D</ref>, <ref refid="classGameWorld" kindref="compound">GameWorld</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
